# Repfigit-loop machine-local state (PR review cache, routing decisions).
# These churn on every pass and would otherwise leave the working tree dirty,
# which trips the builder's clean-tree preflight check on every run.
# builder-context.md is deliberately NOT ignored — it is durable repo knowledge.
.repfigit-loop/*.json
.repfigit-loop/traces/

# Private commercial operations and local bot state belong outside this repository.
docs/commercial/
.hermes/
.vercel
.env*
